Thesis AI Model/Healthy_Leaves/
Thesis AI Model/Yellowing/
Thesis AI Model/Coconut_Scale_Insect/
Thesis AI Model/Rhinoceros_Beetle/
Thesis AI Model/Non-palms/
Thesis AI Model/notebook_dataset/
Thesis AI Model/model_outputs/candidates/
Thesis AI Model/model_outputs/image_review/
Thesis AI Model/model.ipynb
